   416	### 7.3 Crash safety
   417	
   418	Registry shows: receipt, some delete-intent, some deleted. Collector resumes
   419	from cursor. `acknowledgeRetention` retry → existing receipt → success.
   420	`readJobResult` for tombstoned job → `"job-not-found"` with
   421	`details: { reason: "released" }`.
