   425	## 8. Stale-Run Reconciliation
   426	
   427	Extends existing reconciler to update the durable registry. Called by
   428	`inspectLaunch` on `"launcher-claimed"` or `"running"` with dead PID.
   429	
   430	- Liveness timeout on live PID → indeterminate. Do NOT reconcile.

