    24	implementation-private structures.
    25	
    26	### 0.1 Prerequisites
    27	
    28	Before Turnlock integration can be implemented, a **sessionless execution
    29	engine** must be extracted from the current `async-execution.ts`. This engine:
    30	
    31	- Receives a complete `ResolvedExecutionPlanV2` (including agent snapshots)
    32	- Does not depend on `ExtensionAPI`, `ctx.pi.events`, `ctx.cwd`,
    33	  `ctx.currentSessionId`, or any Pi session state
    34	- Is injectable into both the Turnlock launcher and the existing async flow
    35	
    36	This extraction is tracked separately (future NIB). The design below assumes
    37	the sessionless engine exists as `src/turnlock/sessionless-engine.ts`.
    38	
    39	### 0.2 Topology
    40	
    41	```
    42	Turnlock Runner (Bun)
    43	  └─ Pi strategy adapter
    44	      └─ import "pi-subagents/turnlock"
    45	          ├─ Registry (O_EXCL + ProcessInstanceIdentityV1)
    46	          ├─ LauncherManager (PGID-tracked, signed-challenge liveness)
    47	          ├─ ClaimFence (under-lock atomic, heartbeat re-verification)
    48	          ├─ ResultCollector (cursor-based, tombstone with double retention)
    49	          └─ StaleRunReconciler (indeterminate = not dead)
    50	```
    51	
    52	---
